WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.886
Introducing Mind2Act World.
Reasoning and action, evaluated together.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:10.436
When robots fail, is it the decision,
the execution, or how they work together?

3
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.544
Mind tracks progress, understands rules,
and decides what comes next.

4
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.320
Act turns intent into precise motion,
through geometry, contact, and timing.

5
00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:28.979
Mind2Act closes the loop.
Execution reshapes the plan, step by step.

6
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.191
Fifteen tasks.

7
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.115
Forty-five configurations.

8
00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:38.450
Easy.

9
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:39.873
Medium.

10
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.134
Hard.

11
00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:46.638
Contribute new tasks. Evaluate agents.
Mind2Act World.
